<title>USA: Box Energy searches for acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Box Energy searches for acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Box Energy Corp said Tuesday that it has engaged Amicus Energy Inc to search for proprietary acquisitions.</p>
<p>Amicus is a Houston-based oil and gas company that offers asset evaluation services.</p>
<p>Amicus will evaluate opportunities for Box and conduct due diligence when Box successfully bids on a property, Box said.</p>
<p>The primary focus will be in the Gulf Coast, both on and offshore, Box said.</p>
</text>
